{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card-Based Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards to place buildings and cast spells. Build your own construction deck and craft a unique strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749079843\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relaxed Yet Thrilling Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As night falls, your units automatically defend the Goddess Statue against swarming enemies. Smart unit placement is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749079843\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Relic Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine relics freely for powerful boosts. Each setup opens new tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749079843\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Random Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make decisions in events that shape the battle. Every run is a fresh adventure full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749079843\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183220?t=1749079843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183220?t=1749079843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/52f2d7c7b1a8f7a17450ac574d436cc69aa2e1a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749079843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/52f2d7c7b1a8f7a17450ac574d436cc69aa2e1a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749079843","categories":[{"descripti